 at the restaurant. Misaki ends up spending one summer with the three handsome siblings.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.2}],"value":8.2,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":6450,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}